    "intro_narrative": "You've infiltrated the heavily fortified subterranean data vault of the rogue technology syndicate known as OmniCorp. The air is thick with the hum of cooling fans and the pulsing neon glow of server racks. Suddenly, blaring sirens echo through the concrete corridors—the facility's automated lockdown has engaged, trapping you inside. Your primary objective remains critical: extract the experimental source code secured within the core data drive. The room is a chaotic web of high-tech equipment, cryptic mainframe interfaces, and heavily encrypted computing terminals. Every operator console and cipher dial is part of a complex defense grid that must be systematically dismantled. You will need to trace the data flows, manipulate the systems, and decrypt the security layers to bypass the final biometric safeguards. You only have a narrow window of time before OmniCorp's elite tactical response team sweeps the sector. Focus on the network connections, uncover the right sequence, and secure the objective before it's too late.",
    "narrative_style": "techno_thriller"
